#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/pop-os.md:0
msgid ""
"Learn how to install snap on Pop!_OS from Terminal using APT, refresh paths, "
"and verify a working installation with hello-world."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/pop-os.md:8
msgid "Install snap on Pop!\\_OS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/pop-os.md:10
msgid ""
"Snap can be installed on Pop!\\_OS from the command line. Open *Terminal* "
"from the Applications launcher and type the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/pop-os.md:12
msgid ""
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install snapd\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/pop-os.md:17
msgid ""
"Either log out and back in again, or restart your system, to ensure snap’s "
"paths are updated correctly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/pop-os.md:19
msgid ""
"To test your system, install the [hello-world](https://snapcraft.io/hello-"
"world) snap and make sure it runs correctly:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/pop-os.md:21
msgid ""
"$ sudo snap install hello-world\n"
"hello-world 6.3 from Canonical✓ installed\n"
"$ hello-world\n"
"Hello World!\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/pop-os.md:28
msgid "Snap is now installed and ready to go!"
msgstr ""
